  "name": "Tertiary Study",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You are not satisfied with just what you have, even with how broad your creative endeavors have been. Select a third Artifex’s motif other than the two you have. You gain this motif’s favored tradition and learn its foundation Visionary spell. As with Secondary Study, if this choice grants you a third favored tradition you choose which of these three traditions your spells belong to when you cast your spells, and you can use this new tradition with your motif spell slots. When you gain the Visionary Paragon feat, you also learn and can prepare that motif’s additional 10th rank spell into your 10th rank spell slot.</p>"
